The failure is reproducibly caused by this audit sandbox’s executable-path discovery: both Lean and Lake fail at `IO.appPath`, while the pinned binaries and libraries are present. I’m applying a narrow temporary runtime shim under `/tmp/audit-work` that only supplies the pinned toolchain’s executable path for `/proc/self/exe`; it does not alter the generated project, producer sources, or Lean toolchain files. Then I’ll rerun the exact trusted `check_generation`.
